  "description": "RIDE. FOLD. REPEAT. The new MACINA FOLD combines innovative drive technology, clean design, and maximum flexibility – featuring a redesigned frame. With just a few simple steps, the bike folds down completely – ideal for campers, commuters, or anyone who needs to save space on the go. Whether in your motorhome, car trunk, or on the train – your bike is always with you and ready to ride. At its heart lies the new Bosch Performance Line PX motor: powerful, quiet, and efficient – delivering an impressive 90 Nm of torque, up to 700 watts of peak power, and a support factor of up to 400 %. Together with the Bosch PowerTube battery (500 Wh), the low-maintenance belt drive, and the SHIMANO NEXUS hub gear, every ride on the FOLD becomes a comfortable and carefree experience. Compact, strong, and effortless – the MACINA FOLD brings freedom into every corner of your life.",
